OL,3,GNEWSAWhere to see Christmas lights in
OL,4,Athe West this year
OL,5,
OL,6,FNovember is here and for many, the
OL,7,Fcountdown to Christmas has officially
OL,8,Fstarted.
OL,10,FAs the festive season gets under way,
OL,11,Fso do a variety of seasonal events
OL,12,Facross the West country. Some are grand
OL,13,Faffairs while others are cosier and
OL,14,Fmore intimate.
OL,16,FWhatever your preference, here is a
OL,17,Flist of Christmas light events taking
OL,18,Fplace where you are.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
